 "about": "RenderStalls, 2026-10-17, seed 1, AMD Radeon Pro 5500M (4 GB VRAM), headless Chrome --headless=new at 1600x1143, fresh profile per run, each build served from its own dir and port, one 12 s run per bench, ?bench=zoom,orbit,turn,pan on one load. base: a86c200. new: a86c200 with this change only (src/gpu/kernel.ts, store.ts, the riders' kernelSources, webgpu.js frontAsk). Not a quiet machine: Unity Editor open, Paseo, and peers' GPU runs (TickB's sim hashes and a page check) between and during some runs; the one run that was plainly swung (every pass of every bench about twice base, new3 after-warm) is kept below and was repeated.",
